// ODS: the live prompt projection must never starve a new tool result.
// Each result reaches the model whole (within the per-result cap) when it is
// first sent. Only when all results exceed the aggregate budget are older
// results reduced to a notice, oldest first and down to a low watermark in one
// step, so the sent prefix changes rarely. Short results stay whole. The choice
// depends only on transcript order, so later calls and later attempts send the
// same bytes for the same history.
